# A Certain Substitute Patrolman (adoulin 78): a level 99 Warrior in Western Adoulin. Rising Solstice with SoA current 0
# and 6 (GMs; before Life on the Frontier): no section (his default 502). Pioneer Registration completed and SoA 7
# (Life on the Frontier, GMs): from now on Pioneer Registration's replaceDefault events answer where the quest does not
# (Rising Solstice 580, Clemmar 570, Shipilolo 535, Dangueubert 546, Nylene 562). Zaoso while available: his script 574;
# Rising Solstice 2550, finished on 0: begun (any option), the Western Adoulin Patrol Route. Accepted, Prog 0:
# Rising Solstice 2551; Clemmar (offset 1): nothing from the quest; the patrol in order, Zaoso 2553 .. Nylene 2559, each
# finish adding 1 to Prog, each NPC talked to again at the next Prog: nothing from the quest. At Dangueubert (offset 5)
# a GM sets Prog 3 while 2558 is open: the finish's own check fails, Prog stays 3; Prog 5 again (a GM): 2558, Prog 6.
# Nylene (offset 6): a GM sets Prog 7 while 2559 is open: no increment either (Prog stays 7, not 8).
# Rising Solstice at Prog 6 and 8 (a GM): 2551; Prog 7: 2552, finished: completed (500 bayld, 1000 exp, the key item
# lost: KEYITEM_LOST). Completed: Rising Solstice: no section; Zaoso at Prog 0 (a GM): his script 574.
lists WesternAdoulin/Rising_Solstice/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/Zaoso/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/Clemmar/onTrigger
lists WesternAdoulin/Kongramm/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/Virsaint/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/Shipilolo/onTrigger
lists WesternAdoulin/Dangueubert/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/Nylene/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/2550
lists WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/2552 WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/2553 WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/2558
char zone=WesternAdoulin pos=-152.5,4,-29 job=WAR lvl=99
login
trigger Rising_Solstice                 # available, SoA current 0: no section: default 502
finish-if-event
mission Soa PioneerRegistration current # a GM: SoA 6
trigger Rising_Solstice                 # SoA 6, below Life on the Frontier: no section
finish-if-event
mission Soa PioneerRegistration completed # a GM: the log's current mission cleared
mission Soa LifeOnTheFrontier current   # a GM: SoA 7
trigger Zaoso                           # available: no quest handler: his script 574
finish-if-event
trigger Rising_Solstice                 # available, SoA 7: 2550
finish option=0                         # begun (any option); the Western Adoulin Patrol Route
trigger Rising_Solstice                 # accepted, Prog 0: 2551 (an Event)
finish
trigger Clemmar                         # Prog 0, Clemmar's offset 1: nothing from the quest
finish-if-event
trigger Zaoso                           # Prog 0: 2553
finish                                  # Prog 1
trigger Zaoso                           # Prog 1: nothing from the quest: his script 574
finish-if-event
trigger Clemmar                         # Prog 1: 2554
finish                                  # Prog 2
trigger Clemmar                         # Prog 2: nothing from the quest
finish-if-event
trigger Kongramm                        # Prog 2: 2555
finish                                  # Prog 3
trigger Kongramm                        # Prog 3: nothing from the quest
finish-if-event
trigger Virsaint                        # Prog 3: 2556
finish                                  # Prog 4
trigger Virsaint                        # Prog 4: nothing from the quest
finish-if-event
trigger Shipilolo                       # Prog 4: 2557
finish                                  # Prog 5
trigger Shipilolo                       # Prog 5: nothing from the quest
finish-if-event
trigger Dangueubert                     # Prog 5: 2558
charvar Quest[9][78]Prog 3              # a GM, while 2558 is open
finish                                  # Prog 3, not Dangueubert's 5: no increment (Prog stays 3)
charvar Quest[9][78]Prog 5              # a GM
trigger Dangueubert                     # Prog 5: 2558
finish                                  # Prog 6
trigger Dangueubert                     # Prog 6: nothing from the quest
finish-if-event
trigger Rising_Solstice                 # Prog 6: 2551
finish
trigger Nylene                          # Prog 6: 2559
charvar Quest[9][78]Prog 7              # a GM, while 2559 is open: above Nylene's 6
finish                                  # Prog 7, not Nylene's 6: no increment (Prog stays 7)
trigger Nylene                          # Prog 7: nothing from the quest
finish-if-event
charvar Quest[9][78]Prog 8              # a GM
trigger Rising_Solstice                 # Prog 8: 2551
finish
charvar Quest[9][78]Prog 7              # a GM
trigger Rising_Solstice                 # Prog 7: 2552
finish                                  # completed; the patrol route lost (KEYITEM_LOST)
trigger Rising_Solstice                 # completed: no section
finish-if-event
charvar Quest[9][78]Prog 0              # a GM
trigger Zaoso                           # completed, Prog 0: no quest handler: his script 574
finish-if-event
